### crear usuario
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/users
Content-Type:  application/json

{
    "name":"Juan",
    "email":"Juan12@gmail.com",
    "password":"Juan123456",
}
### Listar usuarios
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/users?page=1&limit=10

### Mostrar a un usuario
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/users/252777eb-7d0f-4ddf-aeb7-ac9215973b9e

### modificar
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:3000/users/4727b2db-2bd3-46b4-beeb-0ea34081654c
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "carlos25MOD",
    "password": "CarlosMODIFICADO54321"
}
### Eliminar usuario
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/users/cf9f5f8b-40e2-4624-8d5f-f09fdd331a2c

### crear usuario con roles
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/users
Content-Type:  application/json

{
    "name":"Ricardo",
    "email":"Ricardo12@gmail.com",
    "password":"Ricardo123456",
    "role_ids":[3, 4]
}